    "title": "Pedestrian struck and killed on I-565; investigation underway - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Javon Williams ,\n7 hours ago HUNTSVILLE, Ala. (WAFF) - A pedestrian was pronounced dead after being hit by a vehicle on I-565 Tuesday night. Huntsville Police officials say officers responded to I-565 near Triana Boulevard regarding an accident involving a pedestrian. When officers arrived, they located the pedestrian, who was pronounced dead on the scene. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
